{"c":[{"id":"7c5ef48db5fe3c10","sum":"drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy imports; version/init/-h omit optional imports; 3.14 import tracing; perf-shards #49-52 shipped (#53 deferred); same-leaf-set conflicts keep one variant; wake never cuts over-budget views.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ad4caf8a4e44a08e","sum":"PR #55: zoom pack map by node.name; catalog treats git-visible /.summem/ paths as started stores. drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those; 3.14 traces driver __import__","tree":{"c":[{"id":"ee4b855f3bb41c18","sum":"PR #55 zoom pack map by node.name; catalog treats git-visible /.summem/ paths as started stores, not only config.toml","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T202720Z-e2156bfaebf2808e","text":"PR #55 review: zoom pack map keyed by node.name so a shared content id prints the first list_view row; _index_tree inside loads_tree try so unprojectable children skip like other unreadable packs.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T202837Z-054930bcd901bdc3","text":"Root catalog treats any git-visible path under /.summem/ as a started store, not only config.toml; file-level ignore of config.toml cannot hide a store that has notes.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ba93ada09ab368a1","sum":"drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those imports; 3.14 isolation traces driver __import__, not fcntl absent from sys.modules","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T203211Z-4806c48701ff1fd1","text":"Issue #52 L2 drop-dataclasses: slots for five types + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random; version/init/help must not import those three; 3.11 gate stays after import sys; argparse leftover optional","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T204312Z-499edef570adadd5","text":"3.14 pathlib imports fcntl; startup isolation tests must trace the driver's __import__, not assert fcntl absent from sys.modules","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cf60f219a2792389","sum":"drop-dataclasses: slots + lazy imports, 3.14 traces driver imports; perf-shards #49-52 shipped, #53 deferred; same-leaf-set conflicts take one side's .summem paths; wake never drops nodes to fit WAKE_LINES.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"487ebdfd573e5b55","sum":"drop-dataclasses archived: slots + lazy imports; py3.14 startup traces driver imports. perf-shards L4 archived: #49-52 merged via #54-57; #53 deferred (heal ~1ms, stem-hash cannot skip note).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T204853Z-9fffd75ba86574c8","text":"drop-dataclasses archived: slots + lazy tomllib/fcntl/subprocess/random/argparse; version/init/-h skip those imports; 3.14 isolation traces driver __import__; memory-bank/archive/enhancements/20260825-drop-dataclasses.md","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T213440Z-4f6d26cb15712799","text":"perf-shards L4 archived to memory-bank/archive/systems/20260825-perf-shards.md; #49–#52 merged as #54–#57; #53 won't-do-YET (leftover heal ~1ms; stem-hash cannot skip note).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b8d0c71e201b6a9e","sum":"Conflicting same-leaf-set naps: take every .summem path from one side; wake never drops view nodes to fit WAKE_LINES — over-budget lists all until note/nap fold.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T213542Z-65041798fe3dbbfa","text":"Same leaf-set id with different nested captions add/add-conflicts both .tree and .summ; never mismatch a stem; take every conflicting .summem path from one side (#59).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T221202Z-91f4493afe6aed99","text":"Wake never drops view nodes to fit WAKE_LINES; over-budget (including 0) lists every node; note/nap fold the count back.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ad7350b1d6b9b2cd","sum":"Nap stems are five-part seq-leafset-grain-pair-digest; a four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; zipper keeps lex-greatest; driver reads five-part only, migrate.py is the sole four-part reader; child_nap_stem names rematerialize.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"90d7e5acee519c7f","sum":"Nap stems are five-part seq-leafset-grain-pair-digest; zipper keeps lex-greatest; migrate.py (operator-only, sibling-load by __file__) rewrites old stems. #61 supersedes #59; wake-never-cut archived as #60.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"820f42beb587e299","sum":"wake-never-cut archived (#60); Issue #61 added five-part nap stems with pair-byte variants; migrate.py is an operator-only surgery analogue.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260825T222443Z-9e0ebfff2047eda7","text":"wake-never-cut archived to memory-bank/archive/bug-fixes/20260825-wake-never-cut.md; draft PR #60.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260825T230722Z-c53313e27e6b7b27","text":"Issue #61 L3: five-part nap stems with pair-bytes variant tag; operator migrate.py is a surgery analogue, not a summem verb.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"2ce00208bcbe0278","sum":"Nap stems are five-part seq-leafset-grain-pair-digest; zipper keeps lex-greatest; migrate rewrites old stems. nap-variant-stems QA: 346 tests. surgery.plan_break_out duplicates child-stem logic; migrate loads sibling summem by __file__ from cwd.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T001753Z-7316415cc5604024","text":"Nap stems are five-part {seq}-{leafset}-{grain}-{pair-digest}; git unions same-block variants; zipper keeps the lex-greatest; migrate.py rewrites four-part stores.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T002702Z-26707560339bbbf7","text":"QA PASS nap-variant-stems (346 tests py311-314). surgery.plan_break_out duplicates rematerialize_child's child-stem block with no test pinning them equal. migrate.py loads sibling summem by __file__ and takes its store from cwd.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"cf83f26b93a1e0ab","sum":"Four-part nap stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; driver lists five-part stems only and migrate.py is the only four-part reader; child_nap_stem names rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists git root only when .summem is a directory.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"0f04308dc7e8c4c7","sum":"Nap-variant-stems: four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch; child_nap_stem names rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists git root only when .summem is a directory.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T003014Z-adbfa7448201be34","text":"Nap-variant-stems reflected: QA PASS, 346 tests; a four-part stem is a prefix of its five-part twin so lex heal needs no format branch.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T004034Z-6b4ff0568eccf9a6","text":"child_nap_stem is the shared serialize-then-name path for rematerialize and surgery; started_stores lists the git root only when .summem is a directory.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8ebfa75808b2336c","sum":"Driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T004244Z-cbe9baa615b860a5","text":"PR #62 is the five-part nap-stem draft; closes #61 and supersedes #59.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T005232Z-a1d8ce977ef75db8","text":"Clean break: driver lists five-part nap stems only; migrate.py is the only four-part reader.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
